# Accepted-risk findings for the Trivy scans in
# .github/workflows/security-scan.yml (filesystem vulnerability scan and
# Dockerfile config scan) and .github/workflows/release-docker.yml (built
# image scan).
#
# One CVE/GHSA/AVD ID per line, followed by a short reason and a link to the
# issue/PR that accepted the risk. Lines starting with # are ignored.
#
# Example:
# CVE-2023-00000  base image fix pending upstream, tracked in CEL-000
